SET TALK OFF
SET SAFETY OFF
ON ERROR ? "MINT-ERROR", ERROR(), MESSAGE()
STORE "" TO WHICH, ACTIVEP, ACTIVEA
SET PROCEDURE TO LIBRARY
DO SAME
STORE WHICH TO BEFORE
CLOSE PROCEDURE
DO SAME
STORE WHICH TO AFTERP
SET PROCEDURE TO LIBRARY
CLOSE ALL
DO SAME
STORE WHICH TO AFTERA
SET PROCEDURE TO LIBRARY
DO FINISHP
DO SAME
STORE WHICH TO ACTIVEPD
SET PROCEDURE TO LIBRARY
DO FINISHA
DO SAME
STORE WHICH TO ACTIVEAD
SET ALTERNATE TO GOLD.OUT
SET ALTERNATE ON
? "[DO-BEGIN]"
? "BEFORE", BEFORE
? "CLOSE PROCEDURE", AFTERP
? "CLOSE ALL", AFTERA
? ACTIVEP, ACTIVEPD
? ACTIVEA, ACTIVEAD
? "[DO-END]"
SET ALTERNATE TO
QUIT
